      "claim": "Skeptic is right that strict liability without discovery rights is theater, and Accelerationist's telemetry-conditioned safe harbor — hardware attestation, cryptographic audit trails, rebuttable presumption against developers when logs are missing — is a genuine causation-building mechanism for the remediable-harm tier.",
